  "description": "Robe ColorMix 150 AT Profile, a static (non-moving) 150 W CDM discharge luminaire. Robe's sheet for the sibling ColorMix 150 AT wash calls it a static luminaire for floor or ceiling mounting. It sits in a slotted U bracket (bail) with a base plate, and the head tilts by hand on knobs in the bracket. The head is a rounded ovoid body roughly 37 cm across with a circular front lens. Behind the lens sits one light source with no emitter array, so there is one intensity cell. Colour and gobo wheels are selector controls only, not modelled.",
